:10</ref> + 6 t., 3 feminine plural <bdbarc>לֶהֶוְיָן</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 5:17\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,17)\">Dan 5:17</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine plural <bdbarc>הֱווֺ</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:22\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,22)\">Ezra 4:22</ref>, <bdbarc>הֲזוֺ</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:6\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,6)\">Ezra 6:6</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>come to pass</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:28\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,28)\">Dan 2:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 2:29\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,29)\">Dan 2:29</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Dan 2:45\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,45)\">Dan 2:45</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>come into being, arise</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezra 7:23\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(15,7,23)\">Ezra 7:23</ref> <highlight>become, come to be</highlight>, with predicate noun <ref ref=\"Dan 4:24\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,24)\">Dan 4:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 5:29\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,29)\">Dan 5:29</ref> and ( = <highlight>represent</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Dan 7:23\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,23)\">Dan 7:23</ref> with <bdbarc>כְּ</bdbarc> <highlight>like</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:35\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,35)\">Dan 2:35</ref> a, with <bdbarc>ל</bdbarc> predicate v<ref ref=\"Dan 2:35\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,35)\">Dan 2:35</ref> b, with adjective predicate <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:6\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,6)\">Ezra 6:6</ref>, with adverb phrase <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:5\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,5)\">Ezra 5:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 4:22\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,22)\">Dan 4:22</ref> often periphrastic, with participle: <bdbarc>׳</bdbarc><bdbarc>יְדִיעַ לה</bdbarc> <highlight>let become known</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 3:18\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(27,3,18)\">Dan 3:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:12\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,12)\">Ezra 4:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:13\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,13)\">Ezra 4:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:8\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,8)\">Ezra 5:8</ref> <highlight>let it be given</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:8\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,8)\">Ezra 6:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:9\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,9)\">Ezra 6:9</ref>, also <ref ref=\"Ezra 7:26\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(15,7,26)\">Ezra 7:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 2:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,20)\">Dan 2:20</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>be</highlight>, as copula, with adjective predication <ref ref=\"Dan 2:40\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,40)\">Dan 2:40</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 2:42\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,42)\">Dan 2:42</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 7:19\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,19)\">Dan 7:19</ref